      "model_card": "Use edit.append_regular_polygons only when the user wants to add regular polygon features into an existing polygon layer. This directly edits the target dataset and requires edit authorization. For one polygon, pass center_x, center_y, radius, radius_unit, sides, optional name. For multiple polygons, pass features array items; shared radius_unit, radius, sides, or start_angle_degrees may stay at top level.",
      "parameters_schema": {
