      "model_card": "Use edit.create_star_polygon when the user asks to create star polygon features, including 五角星. For one star, pass center_x, center_y, outer_radius, outer_radius_unit, output_name, optional point_count. For multiple stars in the same output layer, pass features array items with center_x, center_y, optional name; shared outer_radius, outer_radius_unit, inner_radius, inner_radius_unit, point_count, or start_angle_degrees may stay at top level. Do not create one shapefile per star unless the user explicitly asks for separate layers.",
      "parameters_schema": {
